{"id":"c2ca1af9af149e69","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-formula.md","title":"Formula","display":"df-formula — Formula","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-formula","aliases":["93-df-formula"],"display":"df-formula — Formula","depends_on":["[[93-df-atomic-formula]]","[[93-df-term]]","[[93-df-similarity-type]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-formula — Formula"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"29c276bf04747b93\" href=\"?note=29c276bf04747b93\" title=\"93-df-atomic-formula\">93-df-atomic-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca7404158049be33\" href=\"?note=ca7404158049be33\" title=\"93-df-term\">93-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" href=\"?note=ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" title=\"93-df-similarity-type\">93-df-similarity-type</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> is the fixed connective similarity type and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{At}_{93}=\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{At}_{93}=\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_{\\tau_{\\mathcal L}}(\\mathrm{At}_{93})\">\\(T_{\\tau_{\\mathcal L}}(\\mathrm{At}_{93})\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{App}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{App}_{93}\\)</span> are the term algebra and tagged constructor of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ca7404158049be33\" href=\"?note=ca7404158049be33\" title=\"93-df-term\">93-df-term</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau)\">\\(\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VarSupp}_{93}(-;\\tau)\">\\(\\operatorname{VarSupp}_{93}(-;\\tau)\\)</span> are the type-indexed formula carrier and variable-support function defined here.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Formula}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Formula}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{var}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{voc}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{voc}_{93}\\)</span> are the legacy interfaces for the fixed book-level type <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists S\\,\\exists\\alpha\\,[\\tau_{\\mathcal L}=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S,\\alpha)]\">\\(\\exists S\\,\\exists\\alpha\\,[\\tau_{\\mathcal L}=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S,\\alpha)]\\)</span>；类型化构造 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau)\">\\(\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau)\\)</span> 只在相似型 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 上定义，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VarSupp}_{93}(t;\\tau)\">\\(\\operatorname{VarSupp}_{93}(t;\\tau)\\)</span> 只在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau)\">\\(t\\in\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau)\\)</span> 上定义。递归子句中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\pi_1(\\tau)\">\\(f\\in\\pi_1(\\tau)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar t\\in\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau)^{\\pi_2(\\tau)(f)}\">\\(\\bar t\\in\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau)^{\\pi_2(\\tau)(f)}\\)</span>；旧接口对应地使用固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau)\\coloneqq T_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{At}_{93})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau)\\coloneqq T_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{At}_{93})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{VarSupp}_{93}(x;\\tau)\\coloneqq\\{x\\}\n\\qquad(x\\in\\mathrm{At}_{93})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{VarSupp}_{93}(x;\\tau)\\coloneqq\\{x\\}\n\\qquad(x\\in\\mathrm{At}_{93})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{VarSupp}_{93}(\\operatorname{App}_{93}(f,\\bar t);\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{i&lt;\\pi_2(\\tau)(f)}\n\\operatorname{VarSupp}_{93}(\\bar t(i);\\tau)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{VarSupp}_{93}(\\operatorname{App}_{93}(f,\\bar t);\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{i&lt;\\pi_2(\\tau)(f)}\n\\operatorname{VarSupp}_{93}(\\bar t(i);\\tau)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}formula}\\vdash \\mathrm{Fml}_{93}\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}formula}\\vdash \\mathrm{Fml}_{93}\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}formula}\\vdash \\mathrm{Formula}_{93}(\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{93}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}formula}\\vdash \\mathrm{Formula}_{93}(\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{93}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}formula}\\vdash \\operatorname{var}_{93}(x)\\coloneqq\\{x\\},\\quad\\operatorname{voc}_{93}(x)\\coloneqq\\varnothing\\qquad(x\\in\\mathrm{At}_{93})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}formula}\\vdash \\operatorname{var}_{93}(x)\\coloneqq\\{x\\},\\quad\\operatorname{voc}_{93}(x)\\coloneqq\\varnothing\\qquad(x\\in\\mathrm{At}_{93})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{var}_{93}(\\operatorname{App}_{93}(f,\\bar t))\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{i&lt;\\pi_2(\\tau_{\\mathcal L})(f)}\\operatorname{var}_{93}(\\bar t(i)),\\quad\n\\operatorname{voc}_{93}(\\operatorname{App}_{93}(f,\\bar t))\\coloneqq\n\\{f\\}\\cup\\bigcup_{i&lt;\\pi_2(\\tau_{\\mathcal L})(f)}\n\\operatorname{voc}_{93}(\\bar t(i))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{var}_{93}(\\operatorname{App}_{93}(f,\\bar t))\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{i&lt;\\pi_2(\\tau_{\\mathcal L})(f)}\\operatorname{var}_{93}(\\bar t(i)),\\quad\n\\operatorname{voc}_{93}(\\operatorname{App}_{93}(f,\\bar t))\\coloneqq\n\\{f\\}\\cup\\bigcup_{i&lt;\\pi_2(\\tau_{\\mathcal L})(f)}\n\\operatorname{voc}_{93}(\\bar t(i))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A propositional formula is a term in its connective signature. The indexed carrier and support map are safe for reusable definitions; the unindexed names remain only as aliases for the explicitly fixed book-level type. The recursive support functions are well-founded on the construction stages of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ca7404158049be33\" href=\"?note=ca7404158049be33\" title=\"93-df-term\">93-df-term</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-atomic-formula","status":"resolved","id":"29c276bf04747b93","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-atomic-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"ca7404158049be33","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-similarity-type","status":"resolved","id":"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-similarity-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"ca7404158049be33","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T_{\\tau_{\\mathcal L}}(\\mathrm{At}_{93})$ and $\\operatorname{App}_{93}$ are the term algebra and tagged constructor of [[93-df-term]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"ca7404158049be33","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"A propositional formula is a term in its connective signature. Th